===Finishing up===
{{Needed|2 [[magic whistle]]s, Falador teleport}}
{{Checklist|
*Travel to [[Camelot]] and talk to King Arthur. '''Make sure to have 1 empty slot in your inventory for [[Magic gold feather]] he gives you.'''
*Travel to [[Goblin Village]].
*Use the '''Open''' option on the sacks in the house in the east side of Goblin Village.
*Talk to Sir Percival, he will take your [[magic whistle]]. Make sure you have another to get to the [[Fisher Realm]] yourself. {{Chat option|2Come with me, I shall make you a king.}}
*Travel back to the Fisher Realm (via Brimhaven or using the [[fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|BJR}}. You do not need to fight the Titan again either way)
*Head to the top floor of the castle's eastern tower and take the [[Holy grail (item)|Holy grail]].
*Return to [[King Arthur]].
*'''Congratulations, quest complete!'''
}}
